要驗測這段 SQL 的 MERGE 邏輯，最有效的 Before / After 測試方式是針對 4 種不同的情境各挑選 2~3 筆樣本。
第一步：找出 4 種情境的測試名單
執行以下查詢，一次抓出所有測試情境的候選資料：
-- 1. 建立當前來源暫存（完全模擬第一段的抽取邏輯）
DROP TABLE IF EXISTS #SrcList;

SELECT 
    A.EntityId AS EntNum,
    D.IdentificationType,
    D.IdentificationNumber,
    MAX(C.UpdatedDate) AS UpdatedDate,
    D.IdentificationType + '; Please go to Dowjones website for more detail' AS TargetAddress
INTO #SrcList
FROM BSADB.dbo.DJ_Entity A
JOIN BSADB.dbo.DJ_ListCategory B          ON A.EntityId = B.EntityId
JOIN BSADB.dbo.DJ_List_Data_A C           ON A.EntityId = C.EntNum
JOIN BSADB.dbo.DJ_IdentificationTypeInfo D ON A.EntityId = D.EntityId
WHERE A.PersonStatus <> 'Inactive'
  AND (
        B.Description2 = 'Sanctions Lists'
     OR B.Description3 IN (
            'OFAC Related - Majority Owned',
            'OFAC Related - Control',
            'OFAC - Regional Sanctions Related - Majority Owned',
            'OFAC - Regional Sanctions Related - Control',
            'EU Related - Majority Owned',
            'EU Related - Control',
            'EU - Regional Sanctions Related - Majority Owned',
            'EU - Regional Sanctions Related - Control'
        )
      )
  AND B.Deleted = 0
  AND D.IdentificationType IN (
        'Aircraft Construction, Line, Fleet or Serial Number',
        'Aircraft Manufacturer''s Serial Number (MSN)',
        'Bank Identifier Code (BIC)',
        'Central Registration Depository (CRD)',
        'Company Identification No.',
        'Driving Licence No.',
        'DUNS Number',
        'International Maritime Organization (IMO) Ship No.',
        'International Securities Identification Number (ISIN)',
        'Legal Entity Identifier (LEI)',
        'National ID',
        'National Provider Identifier (NPI)',
        'National Tax No.',
        'Others',
        'Passport No.',
        'Social Security No.',
        'Email',
        'Fax',
        'Phone'
      )
  AND D.Deleted = 0
GROUP BY 
    A.EntityId, 
    D.IdentificationType, 
    D.IdentificationNumber;

-- 2. 撈出 4 種測試情境的名單
-- 【情境 A：全新新增 (Insert)】來源有，但 Target (OFAC_GLSpec) 完全沒有
SELECT TOP 3 'Case A: Insert (全新)' AS TestCase, S.*
FROM #SrcList S
LEFT JOIN BSADB.dbo.OFAC_GLSpec T
  ON T.GROUPID = 10
 AND T.spec_name = S.IdentificationNumber
 AND T.remark = CAST(S.EntNum AS VARCHAR(100))
 AND T.ADDRESS = S.TargetAddress
WHERE T.spec_name IS NULL;

-- 【情境 B：更新日期 (Update - Date Modified)】兩邊都有且 DInd='N'，但 UpdatedDate 不一致
SELECT TOP 3 'Case B: Update (日期變更)' AS TestCase, 
       S.EntNum, S.IdentificationNumber, S.IdentificationType, 
       S.UpdatedDate AS Src_UpdatedDate, T.updated_date AS Tgt_UpdatedDate, T.DInd
FROM #SrcList S
JOIN BSADB.dbo.OFAC_GLSpec T
  ON T.GROUPID = 10
 AND T.spec_name = S.IdentificationNumber
 AND T.remark = CAST(S.EntNum AS VARCHAR(100))
 AND T.ADDRESS = S.TargetAddress
WHERE T.DInd = 'N' 
  AND S.UpdatedDate <> T.updated_date;

-- 【情境 C：重新啟用 (Update - Reactivate)】來源有，但 Target 原本是 DInd = 'Y' (被軟刪除)
SELECT TOP 3 'Case C: Reactivate (重啟)' AS TestCase, 
       S.EntNum, S.IdentificationNumber, S.IdentificationType, T.DInd AS Tgt_DInd
FROM #SrcList S
JOIN BSADB.dbo.OFAC_GLSpec T
  ON T.GROUPID = 10
 AND T.spec_name = S.IdentificationNumber
 AND T.remark = CAST(S.EntNum AS VARCHAR(100))
 AND T.ADDRESS = S.TargetAddress
WHERE T.DInd = 'Y';

-- 【情境 D：軟刪除 (Update - Soft Delete)】Target 原本是 DInd='N'，但來源已經不存在/下架
SELECT TOP 3 'Case D: Delete (下架刪除)' AS TestCase, 
       T.ent_num, T.spec_name, T.remark, T.ADDRESS, T.DInd
FROM BSADB.dbo.OFAC_GLSpec T
LEFT JOIN #SrcList S
  ON T.spec_name = S.IdentificationNumber
 AND T.remark = CAST(S.EntNum AS VARCHAR(100))
 AND T.ADDRESS = S.TargetAddress
WHERE T.GROUPID = 10
  AND T.DInd = 'N'
  AND S.IdentificationNumber IS NULL;

第二步：Before 狀態備份與紀錄
從上方選定目標名單後（將其 EntNum 填入 WHERE 條件），在執行您的同步 Script 前留存 Baseline：
-- 替換為剛才挑選出的 EntNum (填入 remark)
SELECT 
    ent_num, spec_name, remark, ADDRESS, updated_date, DInd, EnterFlag, 
    ApprovedBy, DelDate, creDate
FROM BSADB.dbo.OFAC_GLSpec
WHERE GROUPID = 10 
  AND remark IN ('12345', '67890'); -- 填入選定的測試 EntNum

第三步：執行同步並驗證 After 結果
執行您的完整 MERGE Script，隨後執行以下驗證：
-- 1. 查看 OFAC_GLSpec 表的變化
SELECT 
    ent_num, spec_name, remark, ADDRESS, updated_date, DInd, EnterFlag, 
    ApprovedBy, DelUserID, DelDate, updated_date_UTC
FROM BSADB.dbo.OFAC_GLSpec
WHERE GROUPID = 10 
  AND remark IN ('12345', '67890');

-- 2. 查看 OFAC_GLSpec_Log 的寫入與 ActionCD
SELECT TOP 20
    ent_num, spec_name, remark, DInd, ActionCD, ActionDt, updated_date
FROM BSADB.dbo.OFAC_GLSpec_Log
WHERE GROUPID = 10 
  AND remark IN ('12345', '67890')
ORDER BY ActionDt DESC;

After 檢核重點：
 * 全新新增 (Case A)：OFAC_GLSpec.DInd = 'N'，Log 表有對應紀錄且 ActionCD = '01'。
 * 日期更新 (Case B)：OFAC_GLSpec.updated_date 變更為最新日期，Log 表 ActionCD = '02'。
 * 重新啟用 (Case C)：OFAC_GLSpec.DInd 從 'Y' 變為 'N'，清除 DelUserID/DelDate，Log 表 ActionCD = '01'。
 * 下架刪除 (Case D)：OFAC_GLSpec.DInd 變為 'Y'，寫入 DelDate/DelUserID = 'System Admin'，Log 表 ActionCD = '03'。
